# ── Cloudflare D1 (telemetry DB) ──
# Local dev needs nothing here: the bot writes the miniflare local D1 file via
# node:sqlite (create it with `npm run db:apply:local`), and the dashboard reads
# the D1 binding from wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Only set these to push schema to / write REMOTE D1 (drizzle-kit db:push and the
# bot's D1 HTTP write path). Get a D1 API token from the Cloudflare dashboard.
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""
# CLOUDFLARE_DATABASE_ID=""
# CLOUDFLARE_D1_TOKEN=""
# STEVE_D1_REMOTE=1   # make the bot write to remote D1 instead of the local file
